        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bruce Conner, Jaap Speyer\n- Works: Marilyn Times Five, The Red Night\n- Roles: artist, filmmaker, film director\n- Topics: experimental film, German silent film\n\nFacts:\n- Jaap Speyer was a Dutch film director who lived from 1891 to 1952.\n- The Red Night is a 1921 German silent film directed by Jaap Speyer.\n- Bruce Conner was an American artist who lived from November 18, 1933 to July 7, 2008.\n- Bruce Conner was renowned for assemblage, film, drawing, sculpture, painting, collage, and photography.\n- Marilyn Times Five is a 1973 experimental film by American filmmaker Bruce Conner.",
